//! Runtime type introspection — type checking, field access, and construction.
//
// This module exposes type-checking and field access as a stable API.
// Implementations (VM, compiled native, WASM) provide these as intrinsics.
// User code and stdlib should use Reflect rather than coupling to internals.
//
// Usage:
//   import "@reflect" as Reflect
//   Reflect.is_string(value)
//   Reflect.fields(instance)
//
// All functions here are stubs that will be backed by native intrinsics.
// The native C module (src/libc/reflect.c) provides the actual implementation.
